      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1936708
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-25T17:38:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Bart,\n\nThanks for your comment.\n\nWe already had discussions for the same in below patch and were about to post the series but we are facing resistance in the upstream community as they don\u0027t want these hooks.\n\nBut as per the earlier discussions we got the intuition that maintainability was the main concern by upstream (1000+ lines of code) hence we came up with this newer approach of hooks to limit the lines of code in core layer by bringing the complete code inside vendor specific files just by adding two hooks but seems like we need to revive the older thread again in upstream and get the clarity on what direction we need to go in which will take some time. Meanwhile can we please have these patches for the current ACK kernel and meanwhile we\u0027ll continue the discussion with upstream.\n\nhttps://patchwork.kernel.org/project/linux-mmc/patch/20230401165723.19762-2-quic_sartgarg@quicinc.com/",
      "parentUuid": "e78302bb_9b250076",
      "revId": "5c8fec5a0ff0ba43756d49aea4a6847bbe152d15",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b533873b_36ff65b8",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1869780
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-25T17:50:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please address the feedback provided by the upstream kernel community.\n\nPlease follow the Android \"upstream first\" policy.\n\nPlease do not mark this comment as \"resolved\" before the above concerns have been addressed.\n\nExporting a large number of functions without agreement from the upstream kernel community would make the Android kernel much harder to maintain than necessary.",
      "parentUuid": "b35cca57_700a0e9a",
      "revId": "5c8fec5a0ff0ba43756d49aea4a6847bbe152d15",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
